      "ipa": "/kʉː/",
      "letterAudio": "audio/sv/letters/sv-q.mp3",
      "memoryTrick": "Very rare in Swedish — nearly always followed by 'u' and pronounced like 'kv'. Think of it as a fancy 'k' that only appears in loanwords. The letter name sounds like 'kew' in English.",
      "words": [
        { "text": "quiz", "roman": "kviss", "meaning": "quiz", "audio": "audio/sv/words/sv-q-01.mp3" },
