      "ipa": "/ær/",
      "letterAudio": "audio/sv/letters/sv-r.mp3",
      "memoryTrick": "A rolled or tapped 'r' — flick the tip of your tongue against the ridge behind your upper teeth, once or twice. In southern Sweden it's a throaty French-style 'r' instead. Either way, it's always pronounced, never silent.",
      "words": [
