      "ipa": "/ˈdɵbːɛlˌveː/",
      "letterAudio": "audio/sv/letters/sv-w.mp3",
      "memoryTrick": "Called 'double-v' in Swedish, and pronounced just like a regular Swedish 'v'. It appears almost exclusively in loanwords and names. Don't say 'double-u' — Swedes will think that's very English of you!",
