      "letterAudio": "audio/sv/letters/sv-x.mp3",
      "memoryTrick": "Pronounced like 'ks' (as in 'box'). Uncommon in Swedish apart from loanwords and the prefix 'ex-' (meaning former). The letter name rhymes with 'sex'.",
